gg"},{"description":"CH0273_Battle_Recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"感谢！","text_original":"感謝します！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Battle_Recovery_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Battle_Retire","category":"battle","text":"还、还没能将这歌声传递出去。","text_original":"ま、まだ、歌を届けられていません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Battle_Retire.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Battle_Shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Battle_Shout_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Battle_Shout_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Battle_Shout_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Battle_Shout_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Battle_Shout_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Battle_TacticalAction_1","category":"battle","text":"呀！","text_original":"やっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Battle_TacticalAction_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Battle_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"让我们在下一次演出再相见吧。","text_original":"また次のステージでお会いしましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Battle_Victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Battle_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"美好的时光总是转瞬即逝。","text_original":"楽しい時間はあっという間でしたね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Battle_Victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"真是让人舒心的空间呢。","text_original":"とても心地よい空間ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"感觉好像哪有视线在盯着我……？","text_original":"何か視線を感じるような……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"接下来要做什么呢……？","text_original":"次はなにをしましょう……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"有什么我能帮忙的吗？","text_original":"何かお手伝いできることはありませんか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"握手会……？合影……？","text_original":"握手会……？チェキ……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"闪、闪闪亮亮~哈哇……！？","text_original":"き、きらきら～……はわ……！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_CommonSkill.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventLobby_1","category":"event","text":"啊啦，老师，怎么了？","text_original":"あら先生、どうなさいました？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventLobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventLobby_2","category":"event","text":"啊！请、请等一下！现、现在我……我还全身是汗……","text_original":"わっ！ま、待ってください！い、今は、そ、その……汗をかいてますから……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventLobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventLobby_3","category":"event","text":"签名……吗？抱、抱歉，我完全没想过这个……！","text_original":"サイン……ですか？す、すみません全然考えてなくて……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventLobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventLobby_4","category":"event","text":"这次演出，我要不留遗憾！","text_original":"悔いの残らない、最高のステージにしてみせます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventLobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"您好，老师。有空的话，请来……来看看我的演出！","text_original":"こんにちは、先生。よろしければ、私のステージ…見ていってください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventLogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"准备好了吗？演出马上就要开始了！","text_original":"準備はよろしいですか？間もなく、ライブがはじまります！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventLogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventLogin_Season_1","category":"event","text":"演出还在继续哦！","text_original":"まだまだライブは続きますよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventLogin_Season_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"event","text":"演出下半场，继续加油吧！","text_original":"ライブ後半戦、頑張りましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventLogin_Season_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventLogin_Season_End","category":"event","text":"呼……我全力以赴了呢！老师您还满意吗？","text_original":"ふぅ…目一杯出し切りました！先生は楽しめたでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventLogin_Season_End.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventShop_1","category":"event","text":"老、老师……？","text_original":"せ、先生……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventShop_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventShop_2","category":"event","text":"别、别管我……看那边啦……呵呵，哈哈哈……！","text_original":"わ、私ではなく…あちらを…ふふ、あははっ…！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventShop_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventShop_Buy_1","category":"event","text":"那个呀。我也觉得很不错哦！","text_original":"そちらですね。とても素敵だと思います！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventShop_Buy_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventShop_Buy_2","category":"event","text":"我对那个也很感兴趣。","text_original":"私もそれ気になっていました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventShop_Buy_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventShop_Buy_3","category":"event","text":"买那个是吗？好的，给您。","text_original":"そちらになさいますか？はい、どうぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventShop_Buy_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventShop_Buy_4","category":"event","text":"这个是吧。好的，给您。","text_original":"こちらですね。はい、どうぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventShop_Buy_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventShop_End","category":"event","text":"请注意不要遗忘随身物品！","text_original":"お忘れ物がないよう、お気をつけください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventShop_End.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventShop_Login_1","category":"event","text":"您在找什么吗？","text_original":"何をお探しでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventShop_Login_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_EventShop_Login_2","category":"event","text":"请随意挑选！我推荐的是……","text_original":"お好きなものをどうぞ！私のオススメは……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_EventShop_Login_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"像练习时一样去演出……！","text_original":"本番は練習のように……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_ExSkill_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"相信自己……！","text_original":"自分を信じて……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_ExSkill_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"我一定会做到的！","text_original":"私、やってみせますから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_ExSkill_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"请接受……这份心意！","text_original":"この想い……受け取ってください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"愿这份感情传达给您……！","text_original":"あなたに届きますように……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"我想成为大家的力量！","text_original":"皆さんのお力になりたいんです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"感觉现在，我对老师什么都能说出口。那个……所以，请您听完就忘掉吧。……从今往后，请您永远留在我身边。约好了哦。","text_original":"今なら、なんでも先生に言えるような気がするんです。その……なので、聞いても忘れてくださいね。……これからも、ずっと私のそばにいてください。約束ですよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_ExWeapon_Get.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"站位，OK！","text_original":"ポジション、OKです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Formation_In_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"站在这里可以吗？","text_original":"この位置で大丈夫でしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Formation_In_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Formation_Select","category":"formation","text":"好的！准备就绪，老师。","text_original":"はい！準備はできておりますよ、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Formation_Select.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"虽然我没有什么当偶像的经验……但我会尽我所能的。请多关照，老师！","text_original":"アイドルはあまりやったことがありませんが……精いっぱい努めて参りますね。よろしくお願いいたします、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"这些是……老师是要当我的赞助人吗？我会努力不负老师期待的！","text_original":"これは……先生がスポンサーになってくださっている、ということでしょうか？ご期待に応えられるよう、頑張ります！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"感谢您的关心。我会用最好的演出回报老师的！","text_original":"お心遣い、感謝いたします。最高のパフォーマンスでお返しいたしますね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"不知为何，我感觉紧张缓解下来了……这一定多亏了是老师吧。","text_original":"不思議と、緊張がやわらぐような……きっと、先生のおかげですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"多亏了老师，我感觉越来越自信了。感觉现在我什么都能做到！","text_original":"先生のおかげで、自信がどんどん湧いてきます。今なら、何でもできるような気がするんです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"若老师希望的话……无论是在舞台上，还是其他任何地方……我都会为您献上一曲。","text_original":"先生がお望みでしたら……ステージでも、それ以外でも……歌を届けます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"若我的歌声能让老师幸福……我就别无他求了。","text_original":"私の歌で先生が幸せになってくださるのなら……それ以上望むことはありません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"握、握手吗？好的，请。","text_original":"あ、握手ですか？はい、どうぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"哈、哈哈、哈哈哈……！老、老师，好、好痒……！","text_original":"あ、あはっ、あはは……！せ、先生、く、くすぐったいです……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"真是的……老师这么做的话那我也……！嘿！","text_original":"もう……そんなことをするのでしたら私も……！えい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"等您许久了，老师。我都已经准备好了。","text_original":"お待ちしておりました、先生。準備は万全ですよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_LogIn_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"那么请听。第一首歌是，这首。","text_original":"それでは聞いて下さい。一曲目は、この曲です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_LogIn_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，让您久等了！","text_original":"先生、待っていてくださったのですね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"没想到您一直在这等我……","text_original":"まさかずっとここで待っていてくださったなんて……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"那个……演出，如何？","text_original":"その……ステージ、どうでしたか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然从舞台侧面可能看得不是很清楚……","text_original":"舞台袖からだとあんまり良く見えなかったとは思うのですが……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"但想到老师一直注视着我……","text_original":"でも、先生はずっと見守ってくださっていたから……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"即使只是待在舞台侧面，也让人感到安心……","text_original":"舞台袖からでも大丈夫かな……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"那个……我的表演，怎么样？","text_original":"その……パフォーマンス、どうでした？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"我有好好地……成为\"偶像\"吗？","text_original":"ちゃんと……「アイドル」になれていました？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"……！！","text_original":"……！！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"……非常感谢，老师……！","text_original":"……ありがとうございます、先生……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_MemorialLobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"……诶嘿嘿。","text_original":"……えへへ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_MemorialLobby_5_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"老师也对我抱有好感吗？……要是那样就好了。","text_original":"先生も、私のことを好意的に受け止めてくださっているのでしょうか？……そうだと、良いのですが。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Relationship_Up_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"若偶像便是为某人而歌唱的话……我想……成为老师的偶像。","text_original":"誰かのために歌うのがアイドルなら……私は……先生のアイドルになりたいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Relationship_Up_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师……请不要把目光从我身上移开哦……？","text_original":"先生……私から、目を離さないでくださいね……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Relationship_Up_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"这种想法，或许是种罪过……但是，仅仅现在也好……请您注视着我，老师。","text_original":"こんなことを思うのは、罪かもしれません……ですが、今だけは……私を見ていてください、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Relationship_Up_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"我的生日……自己作为主角的日子，不管多少次都没法习惯呢。不过，能听到您这样说，我真的很开心。谢谢您，老师。","text_original":"私の誕生日……自分が主役の日というのは、いつまで経っても慣れませんね。でも、そんな風に言っていただけて、とても嬉しいです。ありがとうございます、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Season_Birthday.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"生日快乐，老师。让我为您献上一首歌吧。","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生。この歌を先生に捧げますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"这、这身衣服不是扮装……但是……如果老师喜欢的话……那我就保持这样吧。","text_original":"こ、これは仮装ではないのですが……でも……先生が気に入っているのでしたら……このままでいますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Season_Halloween.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐，老师。愿今年能将歌声传达给更多的人……愿今年满怀这样的幸福。","text_original":"明けましておめでとうございます、先生。今年もより多くの方に歌を届けられる……そんな幸せに満ちた一年であることを、祈っております。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Season_NewYear.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞夜……这是为大家献上赞美诗的日子。嗯，穿这身衣服来演唱再合适不过了。","text_original":"聖なる夜……賛美歌を皆さんに届ける日です。ええ、歌うのにぴったりの格好ですから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Season_Xmas.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Tactic_Defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"练习还不够吗……","text_original":"練習が足りなかったなでしょうか......","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Tactic_Defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Tactic_Defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"对不起，都是我的失误。","text_original":"すみません、私のミスです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Tactic_Defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Tactic_In_1","category":"battle","text":"将我们的歌声，献给大家！","text_original":"私たちの歌を、皆さんに！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Tactic_In_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Tactic_In_2","category":"battle","text":"愿这份宁静能传递给每一个人。","text_original":"安らぎが届きますように。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Tactic_In_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Tactic_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"真是一场精彩的演出呢。","text_original":"素敵なライブになりましたね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Tactic_Victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Tactic_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"我的表演……如何呢？","text_original":"私のステージ……いかがでしたか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Tactic_Victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0273_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案！","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/jp/CH0273_Title.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0273_battle_buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/kr/ch0273_battle_buffed_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0273_battle_buffself_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/kr/ch0273_battle_buffself_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0273_battle_covered_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/kr/ch0273_battle_covered_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0273_battle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F/kr/ch0273_battle_damage_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0273_battle_damage_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/%E5%81%B6%E5%83%8F